            "ko": "/n/ /e/ /t/ 그물!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "The net has ten hens!",
            "audio": "b2_u03_l4",
            "ko": "그물에 암탉 열 마리!"
          },
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "The pet is wet!",
            "audio": "b2_u03_l5",
            "ko": "애완동물이 젖었어!"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b2_u03_2",
        "ko": "그물이 넓은 돌이 됐어요. 암탉들이 올라타요. 어항 속 금붕어, 젖은 강아지가 물을 털어요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Who is on the net?",
            "ko": "그물 위에 누가 있어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Who is wet?",
            "ko": "누가 젖었어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u03_3",
        "desc": "One brown hen stands on a stepping stone holding a blue ballpoint pen in her beak, scribbling a wavy line on a lily pad; Hedgie giggles. Beads threads h-e-n beside her. At the edge of the reeds there is a cozy den — a round hole under a tree root — and Grumble's masked face peeks out of it with his lantern glowing inside the den, frowning at the noisy hens. Hidden in the picture: the hen, the pen, the den.",
        "hidden": [
          "hen",
          "pen",
          "den"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
