            "ko": "그럼블은 어디 있어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u03_4",
        "desc": "The ten hens walk in a neat line across the new -et and -en stepping stones toward a big flat stone where a kind owl veterinarian in a white coat and round glasses waits with a stethoscope, gently checking the first hen. A toy jet plane lies on the stone beside the vet's bag. Pip sits on the net stone, thinking hard with one wing on its beak; Beads clicks its beads; Bun and Hedgie count the hens on their paws. Hidden in the picture: the vet, the ten hens, the jet, the net. Grumble does NOT appear.",
        "hidden": [
          "vet",
          "ten",
          "jet",
          "net"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "The vet has ten hens.",
            "audio": "b2_u03_l8",
            "ko": "수의사 선생님한테 암탉 열 마리가 왔어요."
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Net? Ten? Net!",
            "audio": "b2_u03_l9",
            "ko": "넷? 텐? 넷! (그물!)"
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "Click-clack! Ten and net!",
            "audio": "b2_u03_l10",
            "ko": "딸깍딸깍! 텐하고 넷!"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "암탉들이 줄지어 올빼미 수의사에게 가요. 핍이 드디어 \"넷!\" 하고 말해요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Who checks the hen?",
            "ko": "누가 암탉을 봐 줘?"
